# TC38 : ObstacleDetectedBoost5
# Related normal-mode case : TC28_ObstacleDetected5
# Precondition : BoostMode, motorDirection=FRONT, forward=false
# Action : backward mode, left clear
# Expected : BoostMode 유지, turnLeft, motorDirection → LEFT, forward=true
power
start
dust
expect mode BoostMode
expect cleaner on
expect cleanerMode boost
expect motorDirection FRONT
obstacle 1 1
obstacle 1 0
expect motorForward false
expect motorDirection FRONT
obstacle 0 0
expect mode BoostMode
expect cleaner on
expect cleanerMode boost
expect motor moving
expect motorForward true
expect motorDirection LEFT
exit
